Question: Did Sorrento Therapeutics break the law by not posting results for its terminated COVID-19 trials?

Snapshot date: 2026-11-05
Research notes: The Lead hit its lookup cap and planned from what it had found.; Stopped at the cap of 3 research rounds.

Findings:
[{"lane": "trials", "round": 1, "brief": "Examine the registry history on ClinicalTrials.gov for Sorrento Therapeutics COVID-19 trials, specifically focusing on NCT04903327 and NCT04900428. Extract their completion or termination dates, official reasons for termination, actual enrollment, and whether results are posted or overdue.", "findings": [{"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 (Study of Intravenous COVI-MSC for Treatment of COVID-19-Induced Acute Respiratory Distress) status is TERMINATED.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed in snapshot and live ClinicalTrials.gov record."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 start date is 2021-11-16, primary completion date is 2022-08-29, and completion date is 2022-11-23.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Dates retrieved directly from trial record."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 official reason for termination is \"Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets\", categorized under enrollment.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Stated directly in registry record."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 actual enrollment was 43 participants.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Retrieved from trial record."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 results are not posted on ClinicalTrials.gov, results due date was 2023-08-29, and results are overdue.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Results due date calculated as primary completion date plus 365 days."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 (Study to Evaluate a Single Intranasal Dose of STI-2099 (COVI-DROPS) in Outpatient Adults With COVID-19 (UK)) status is TERMINATED.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed in snapshot and live ClinicalTrials.gov record."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 start date is 2021-07-16, primary completion date is 2022-03-22, and completion date is 2022-05-06.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Dates retrieved directly from trial record."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 official reason for termination is \"Study was terminated at interim analysis due to drops not working on new variants\", categorized under efficacy.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Stated directly in registry record."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 actual enrollment was 179 participants.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Retrieved from trial record."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 results are not posted on ClinicalTrials.gov, results due date was 2023-03-22, and results are overdue.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Results due date calculated as primary completion date plus 365 days."}, {"claim": "No Drugs@FDA approval found for COVI-MSC, STI-2099, or COVI-DROPS.", "evidence_ids": ["fda:none:covi-msc", "fda:none:sti-2099", "fda:none:covi-drops"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Checked via Drugs@FDA tool."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 1, "brief": "Search SEC filings for Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261) between 2021 and 2023. Look for Form 8-K, 10-Q, or 10-K statements mentioning NCT04903327, NCT04900428, COVI-MSC, or COVI-DROPS to see how the company communicated the trial halts or terminations to investors.", "findings": [{"claim": "Ran out of turns. Records gathered: ctgov:NCT04037241, ctgov:NCT04044742, ctgov:NCT04386980, ctgov:NCT04440007, ctgov:NCT04528667, ctgov:NCT04572776, ctgov:NCT04584697, ctgov:NCT04728698, ctgov:NCT04734860, ctgov:NCT04738175, ctgov:NCT04771351, ctgov:NCT04900428, ctgov:NCT04903327, ctgov:NCT04906694, ctgov:NCT04909879, ctgov:NCT04909892, ctgov:NCT05074394, sql:4e3aad35, sql:d441f0f0.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04037241", "ctgov:NCT04044742", "ctgov:NCT04386980", "ctgov:NCT04440007", "ctgov:NCT04528667", "ctgov:NCT04572776", "ctgov:NCT04584697", "ctgov:NCT04728698", "ctgov:NCT04734860", "ctgov:NCT04738175", "ctgov:NCT04771351", "ctgov:NCT04900428", "ctgov:NCT04903327", "ctgov:NCT04906694", "ctgov:NCT04909879", "ctgov:NCT04909892", "ctgov:NCT05074394", "sql:4e3aad35", "sql:d441f0f0"], "confidence": "low", "notes": ""}], "gaps": ["Researcher hit the 8-turn cap before finishing: Search SEC filings for Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261) between 2021 and 2023. Look for Form 8-K, 10-Q, or 10-K statements mentioning NCT04903327, NCT04900428, COVI-MSC, or COVI-DROPS to see how"]}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 1, "brief": "Identify any journal publications or preprints indexed in PubMed or Europe PMC linked to Sorrento's clinical trials NCT04903327 and NCT04900428. Check the publication dates and summarize what findings, if any, were shared in medical literature.", "findings": [{"claim": "For trial NCT04903327, no directly linked trial publication was found in PubMed or Europe PMC; however, five articles mention the drug name (abivertinib) or related stem cell concepts in Europe PMC without reporting trial-specific results.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Snapshot only, not checked live. These are drug or topic mentions, not trial outcome reports."}, {"claim": "For trial NCT04900428, one Cochrane systematic review published on 2021-09-02 (PMID: 34473343) lists NCT04900428 among its referenced trial registry entries, but the review does not report trial-specific results or findings for this trial.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34473343"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Snapshot only, not checked live. The article is a living systematic review that maps trial registry IDs."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 2, "brief": "Search SEC filings (Form 8-K, 10-Q, and 10-K) for Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261) between 2021 and 2023. Search for mentions of NCT04903327, NCT04900428, COVI-MSC, or COVI-DROPS (and its code STI-2099) to identify any disclosures regarding the halting or termination of these trials.\n\n(Gap to close: The disclosures researcher hit the turn cap in round 1 before searching Sorrento Therapeutics SEC filings for statements on the trials or drugs.)", "findings": [{"claim": "Ran out of turns. Records gathered: sql:d441f0f0.", "evidence_ids": ["sql:d441f0f0"], "confidence": "low", "notes": ""}], "gaps": ["Researcher hit the 8-turn cap before finishing: Search SEC filings (Form 8-K, 10-Q, and 10-K) for Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261) between 2021 and 2023. Search for mentions of NCT04903327, NCT04900428, COVI-MSC, or COVI-DROPS (and its code S"]}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 3, "brief": "Search SEC filings for Sorrento Therapeutics (CIK 0000850261) between 2021 and 2023. Look for Form 8-K, 10-Q, or 10-K statements mentioning NCT04903327, NCT04900428, COVI-MSC, or COVI-DROPS (STI-2099) to find disclosures explaining why these trials were halted or terminated.\n\n(Gap to close: Sponsor CIK matched but SEC filings search for trial terminations was not completed due to turn caps.)", "findings": [{"claim": "No SEC filings are present in the snapshot filings table for any CIK or trial.", "evidence_ids": ["sql:c9675385"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "The filings table in the snapshot is completely empty, preventing SQL-based SEC filing retrieval."}, {"claim": "Live SEC EDGAR searches could not be completed because the SEC_USER_AGENT environment variable is not set.", "evidence_ids": [], "confidence": "high", "notes": "External SEC searches failed due to missing configuration."}], "gaps": ["Unable to search SEC EDGAR live due to missing SEC_USER_AGENT configuration, and the snapshot filings table contains no filing records."]}]

